# Partially randomized PF: keep source, docs, and compact summary tables in git;
# ignore raw runs, caches, logs, and long-running partial outputs.
artifacts/partial_randomized_pf/*
!artifacts/partial_randomized_pf/README.md
!artifacts/partial_randomized_pf/df_cgs_cost_table.json
!artifacts/partial_randomized_pf/df_cgs_cost_tables/
